{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "da778260cb7a1e609679015fb14a25170c32e4eef9b69b8ab50946de398957b6", "ja": "実力派歌唱系ユニット『D/Zeal』……。\n期待の声に応えて、ふたりが帰ってきた！\nユニットに縁のあるアノ場所から、配信番組\n『D/Zeal★CHANNEL』が始まる。", "zh": "实力派唱作组合“D/Zeal”……\n回应着众人的期待，两人归来了！\n从与组合有着渊源的那个地方，网络直播节目\n“D/Zeal★CHANNEL”即将开播。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "93172012439a76bee77171e6c7bc4df93668e66f426cccfceeb73c45d6b1c94c", "ja": "胸に宿った熱はまだ冷めない。\nもっと歌いたいって、叫んでるみたい……。", "zh": "心中燃起的热情还没有冷却。\n仿佛在呐喊着，还想再唱更多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "6f85b199aa476cb087c53e0e0742af61ddf4868e9dab39476c22346e66895f95", "ja": "一瞬前のあたし達を超えて……\nあたしとアンタなら、どこまでも飛べるさ。", "zh": "超越一瞬前的我们……\n只要是我和你，就能飞向无尽的远方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "0b23f33633f8748535818008d4bd59e709c9ea9fe68e38a8373ac4d0b35a7ca4", "ja": "さあ、シズ……行こうか。", "zh": "来吧，静香……我们走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "10e06ecf78895f7848a4c1616005ae39dfe9881827a935d75264747c3ec3a2ad", "ja": "ええ……ジュリア！\n私達の音を届けに！", "zh": "嗯……茱莉亚！\n去传达属于我们的声音吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "00d2b91c2965e415907b6202890ffa0311f71b00b518936126d99cbf9087e3ac", "ja": "みなさん、こんにちは。\nD/Zealの最上静香です！", "zh": "大家好。\n我是D/Zeal的最上静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca2e840b24936883e81b88e59a7642ceff67083fa2c0487d8447da46b478868c", "ja": "生配信ということで、少し緊張していますが、\n精一杯、頑張ります！", "zh": "因为是直播，我有点紧张，不过会竭尽全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "881525e2108b08c677c22b19f2cc21f5395cecb955206e65995c373daf69e4e0", "ja": "ちょっと力が入りすぎじゃないか？\nそれに、挨拶も堅すぎ。", "zh": "是不是有点太用力了？\n而且，打招呼也太正式了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "524a26d1b11423ac869b882c4f8a831ea0ac01150f92c5d7b124ed7e7d4479f6", "ja": "そ、そんなことは……。\nだったらジュリアさん、お手本を見せてください！", "zh": "才、才不是那样……。\n既然如此，茱莉亚先生，请给我示范一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "d00568aa69281998ec7f07d2757d9ef89c6adf3a80399561adeb86a4ad8de5b8", "ja": "いいぜ、しっかり見とけよ？\nカメラは……あ、コレか。", "zh": "行啊，好好看着哦？\n摄像机是……啊，这个啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "257cbd21ee548e061298ca6aa6f25a412e28145979c074063080ecd64d41ffea", "ja": "あたしはジュリア。D/Zealとしては久々だけど、\nみんな元気だったか？　いつも応援サンキュー♪", "zh": "我是茱莉亚。D/Zeal好久没一起活动了，大家都还好吗？一直以来谢谢你们的支持♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "76085816e69da8db9beb4f52ae3c0211b7b8dc46ea3246b017eb6a4c21f4e33c", "ja": "初めてのヤツも、きっといるよな？\n最後まで見てな……ウチらの色に染めてやるよ。", "zh": "第一次来的人，肯定也有吧？\n看到最后哦……我们会让你染上我们的色彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "b9ef096b1e0810a4a988b4d9b997328259c18972186c0a67f3fe495abe0c06fc", "ja": "てな感じだ。\n久しぶりなんだし、サービスしないとな！", "zh": "就是这种感觉。\n难得时隔这么久，当然得好好回馈一下大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "47b78e3c2f2b1a20f31702f37a619b9d00020f8243daaa92b3e6afb02d298fa4", "ja": "サ、サービスなら、私だってできます！\n……あっ。", "zh": "服、服务的话，我也能做到！\n……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "1a2c3d5c2a851ca4caa45319794669971e8e629b24a02872514a5bd6692e6ffb", "ja": "えっと……気づいた方もいると思いますが、\n本日は、ライブハウスからお届けしています。", "zh": "那个……可能已经有人注意到了，\n今天我们是在Live House为大家带来节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "b86ad6315f1675acc094ce213c67ad147cccc1e8c344c23154b290b367e4d6fa", "ja": "ウチらが番組をやる時は、\nこういう場所がいいってリクエストしたんだ。", "zh": "我们做节目的时候，就要求选这种地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "694745aeb1d4791ca91451f089f69ef527d481f59ac0724acf15e5ed549e9b8f", "ja": "そうですね。ドラマでも重要な場所ですし。\nでも、お客さんがいないと少し寂しいかも……。", "zh": "是啊，这里也是电视剧里的重要场景。\n不过，要是没有客人的话，可能会有点寂寞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "7615c1e3517a34be9afcebc82f1d74c2e3041810d0a513f1c778520fac993ce6", "ja": "なら、景気づけに1曲歌うか！\nさっきギターを用意したんだよな。", "zh": "那就唱1首歌来热闹一下吧！\n我刚才准备好了吉他。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "6631f97a238133a4880cf431fd10617ffd3afb6fed187363380f57b853826aca", "ja": "ジュリアさん、ギターは大丈夫です。\nはあ……この先、大丈夫かしら。", "zh": "茱莉亚先生，吉他没问题。\n唉……接下来真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_01_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "215cba35cd3fd3cb56be1eff1c02f4af15b94f8c0f2ddf0d558b8ca8c6596734", "ja": "それでは！　気を取り直して、参りましょう。\n『D/Zeal★CHANNEL』……", "zh": "那么！打起精神来，继续吧。\n『D/Zeal★CHANNEL』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
